WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.250
In Sample Practice, choose + Add Catalog Item.

00:02.250 --> 00:05.750
Choose 3D Printing for a planter you print yourself.

00:05.750 --> 00:08.750
Copper outlines mark the required fields.

00:08.750 --> 00:12.000
Keep “I print / make it” for this planter.

00:12.000 --> 00:15.750
Keep “3D Printed Item” as the item type.

00:15.750 --> 00:24.500
Enter the item name, “4-inch Plant Pot – Sage.”

00:24.500 --> 00:29.750
Enter $14.00 as the selling price, then select Save Item.

00:29.750 --> 00:32.750
The Catalog confirms the save and lists the new planter.
